---

NOTICE: This software implements the Whisper speech recognition architecture
as described in the academic paper:

  "Robust Speech Recognition via Large-Scale Weak Supervision"
  Radford et al., 2022
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2212.04356

This is an independent implementation. The code in this repository is NOT
derived from or based on:
  - OpenAI's Whisper (https://github.com/openai/whisper)
  - ggerganov's whisper.cpp (https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp)
  - ggerganov's ggml (https://github.com/ggerganov/ggml)

The architecture and algorithms are implemented based on publicly available
documentation and the original research paper.

---

MODEL WEIGHTS NOTICE:

The software in this repository is MIT licensed. However, model weights you
use with this software may have their own licenses:

- OpenAI Whisper models: Subject to OpenAI's terms of use
- Distil-Whisper models: Apache 2.0 License (recommended)
- Custom trained models: Subject to your training data license

We recommend using Distil-Whisper models for commercial applications:
https://huggingface.co/distil-whisper
